          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"sd15-vae-posterior-analysis\">SD1.5 VAE Posterior Analysis</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook compares the original Stable Diffusion 1.5 VAE posterior\nagainst finetuned VAE checkpoints. It focuses on whether the latent\nposterior remains suitable for downstream latent Flow Matching training:\nposterior drift, variance collapse, Gaussianity, covariance structure,\nreconstruction quality, random prior decoding, and interpolation\nsmoothness.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The defaults target the <code>v18_sd15_vae_x8_256_minmax</code> run. All paths and\nanalysis limits are editable below.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
